  "body_html": "<p>I love building small tools to help editors and marketeers create more engaging content.</p>\n\n<p>Typically, these tools are super-simple. Often, it's just updating a few <em>CSS Custom Properties</em>, a list of <code>class</code>-names, <code>data</code>-attributes or similar.</p>\n\n<p>I recently build a <em>CSS Transition Tool</em>, so editors can fine-tune how an element, or group of elements, enters the screen when scrolling.</p>\n\n<p>A typical example of this is <em>fade up:</em></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"assets/1190247/eba41072.jpg\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"assets/1190247/eba41072.jpg\" alt=\"Fade up\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"760\" height=\"355\"></a></p>\n\n<p>The tool also allows editors to fine-control the transition of each element in the group:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"assets/1190247/b7c7492c.jpg\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"assets/1190247/b7c7492c.jpg\" alt=\"Zoom in/out\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"304\" data-animated=\"true\"></a></p>\n\n<p>If you want to build a similar tool, read on.</p>\n\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"creating-the-css\" href=\"#creating-the-css\">\n  </a>\n  Creating the CSS\n</h2>\n\n<p>First things first. The tool needs a lot of CSS-classes, that'll control the individual <code>transform</code>-properties. To run the transitions (on scroll, using intersection observer), we'll just add a <code>trs</code>-class to the outermost (parent) element.</p>\n\n<p>We'll be using easings from <a href=\"https://open-props.style/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open Props</a>, so let's start, by importing those:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"k\">@import</span> <span class=\"s2\">'https://unpkg.com/open-props@1.4.14/src/props.easing.css'</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>Next, we need some variables:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nd\">:where</span><span class=\"o\">([</span><span class=\"nt\">class</span><span class=\"o\">*=</span><span class=\"s1\">\"trs-\"</span><span class=\"o\">])</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--dg</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">100deg</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--tx</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">55px</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--ty</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">110px</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--zi</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">0.6</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"py\">--zo</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">1.2</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p><code>--dg</code> is for transitions with <code>degrees</code>, <code>--tx</code> is <code>x</code>-offset, <code>--ty</code> is <code>y</code>-offset, and <code>zi</code> and <code>zo</code>is used for <code>zoom</code>-transitions.</p>\n\n<p>For the transition-classes, we'll use all of these properties, example \"fade-down\":<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nc\">.trs-fdd</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"nl\">opacity</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"nl\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">translate3d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"m\">0px</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">calc</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"m\">-1</span> <span class=\"err\">*</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--ty</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span> <span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>... or \"flip-down\":<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nc\">.trs-fld</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"nl\">backface-visibility</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">hidden</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"nl\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">perspective</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"m\">2500px</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"n\">rotateX</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--dg</span><span class=\"p\">));</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>For delays, durations and easings, we'll add a bunch of micro-classes:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nc\">.trsde-25</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"py\">--delay</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">25ms</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"nc\">.trsde-50</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"py\">--delay</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">50ms</span><span class=\"p\">;</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"c\">/* .etc */</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>When one of the transition-classes has the <code>trs</code>-class, we'll <em>run a transition:</em><br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nd\">:is</span><span class=\"o\">([</span><span class=\"nt\">class</span><span class=\"o\">*=</span><span class=\"s1\">\"trs-\"</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"nc\">.trs</span><span class=\"o\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">opacity</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">translateZ</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"n\">scale</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">transition</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">all</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--duration</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">400ms</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--delay</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">0ms</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--easing</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--ease-1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ease</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>For any child-element <em>within</em> a <code>trs</code>-class, we'll use:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight css\"><code><span class=\"nd\">:is</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"nc\">.trs</span> <span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"nt\">class</span><span class=\"o\">*=</span><span class=\"s1\">\"trs-\"</span><span class=\"o\">])</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">opacity</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">translateZ</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">transition-timing-function</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--easing</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">ease-in-out</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">transition-delay</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--delay</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">0ms</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n  <span class=\"nl\">transition-duration</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">var</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">--duration</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"m\">400ms</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>You can see all the necessary styles in the demo at the end of this tutorial. </p>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"html\" href=\"#html\">\n  </a>\n  HTML\n</h2>\n\n<p>Now for some simple markup for previewing the transitions:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight html\"><code><span class=\"nt\">&lt;div</span> <span class=\"na\">id=</span><span class=\"s\">\"demo\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;div</span> <span class=\"na\">id=</span><span class=\"s\">\"demo1\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nt\">&lt;img</span> <span class=\"na\">src=</span><span class=\"s\">\"image1.jpg\"</span> <span class=\"nt\">/&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;/div&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;div</span> <span class=\"na\">id=</span><span class=\"s\">\"demo2\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nt\">&lt;img</span> <span class=\"na\">src=</span><span class=\"s\">\"image2.jpg\"</span> <span class=\"nt\">/&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;/div&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;div</span> <span class=\"na\">id=</span><span class=\"s\">\"demo3\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"nt\">&lt;img</span> <span class=\"na\">src=</span><span class=\"s\">\"image3.jpg\"</span> <span class=\"nt\">/&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;/div&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">&lt;/div&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>For all the properties we want the editors to play around with, we'll add a <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>, with the CSS <code>class</code>-names as <code>&lt;option value&gt;</code>. </p>\n\n<p>Example:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight html\"><code><span class=\"nt\">&lt;select&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;option</span> <span class=\"na\">value=</span><span class=\"s\">\"trsde-0\"</span> <span class=\"na\">selected</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>0ms<span class=\"nt\">&lt;/option&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;option</span> <span class=\"na\">value=</span><span class=\"s\">\"trsde-25\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>25ms<span class=\"nt\">&lt;/option&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nt\">&lt;option</span> <span class=\"na\">value=</span><span class=\"s\">\"trsde-50\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span>50ms<span class=\"nt\">&lt;/option&gt;</span>\n  ...\n<span class=\"nt\">&lt;/select&gt;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>We'll group the <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>-elements in <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code>s, one for each child-element in the preview-markup:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight html\"><code><span class=\"nt\">&lt;fieldset</span> <span class=\"na\">name=</span><span class=\"s\">\"demo\"</span><span class=\"nt\">&gt;</span> ...\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>Notice the <code>name=\"demo\"</code>-part. We'll use that in JavaScript, so all the controls within this fieldset will target the element in the preview-markup with <code>id=\"demo\"</code>.</p>\n\n<p>Finally, wrap all the editor-markup within a <code>&lt;form id=\"app\"&gt;</code>.</p>\n\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"javascript\" href=\"#javascript\">\n  </a>\n  JavaScript\n</h2>\n\n<p>Since we have a <code>&lt;form&gt;</code>, we just need a single <code>input</code>-event:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight javascript\"><code><span class=\"nx\">app</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"s1\">input</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nx\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"kd\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">node</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nx\">event</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">target</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kd\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">group</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nx\">node</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">closest</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"s1\">fieldset</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n  <span class=\"nb\">document</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">getElementById</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">group</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">name</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"nx\">className</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[...</span><span class=\"nx\">group</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">elements</span><span class=\"p\">].</span><span class=\"nf\">map</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">input</span> <span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"nx\">input</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">value</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"nf\">join</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"nf\">replace</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sr\">/  +/g</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"s1\"> </span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n  <span class=\"nf\">playIt</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"p\">})</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>All there's left to add, is the code for <code>playIt</code>, a simple method that removes the <code>trs</code>-class, and adds it again after a timeout:<br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight javascript\"><code><span class=\"kd\">const</span> <span class=\"nx\">playIt</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"nx\">demo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">classList</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">remove</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"s1\">trs</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span> <span class=\"nf\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"p\">(()</span> <span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"nx\">demo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">classList</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">add</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"s1\">trs</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span> <span class=\"p\">},</span> <span class=\"mi\">400</span><span class=\"p\">);</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>To help our editors re-trigger the animation, let's add a <code>&lt;button id=\"play\"&gt;</code>, that'll also run <code>playIt()</code><br>\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"highlight js-code-highlight\">\n<pre class=\"highlight javascript\"><code><span class=\"nx\">play</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"s1\">click</span><span class=\"dl\">'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"nf\">playIt</span><span class=\"p\">());</span>\n</code></pre>\n<div class=\"highlight__panel js-actions-panel\">\n<div class=\"highlight__panel-action js-fullscreen-code-action\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-on\"><title>Enter fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M16 3h6v6h-2V5h-4V3zM2 3h6v2H4v4H2V3zm18 16v-4h2v6h-6v-2h4zM4 19h4v2H2v-6h2v4z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"highlight-action crayons-icon highlight-action--fullscreen-off\"><title>Exit fullscreen mode</title>\n    <path d=\"M18 7h4v2h-6V3h2v4zM8 9H2V7h4V3h2v6zm10 8v4h-2v-6h6v2h-4zM8 15v6H6v-4H2v-2h6z\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p>And that's it. Very little code, but a great help for editors and marketeers!</p>\n\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>\n  <a name=\"demo\" href=\"#demo\">\n  </a>\n  Demo\n</h2>\n\n<p>Here's the demo. I recommend you click on \"Edit on Codepen\", and then choose \"Full Screen View\":</p>\n\n<p><iframe height=\"600\" src=\"https://codepen.io/stoumann/embed/zYjxZqB?height=600&amp;default-tab=result&amp;embed-version=2\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allowtransparency=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n</iframe>\n</p>\n\n<p>As soon as you change something in the editor, click on the \"See code\". </p>\n\n<p><em>Example:</em></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"assets/1190247/d8fcc3e0.jpg\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"assets/1190247/d8fcc3e0.jpg\" alt=\"Code snippet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"218\"></a></p>\n\n<p>Here, you can see, that some of the classes we created in the beginning of this tutorial, has been added to the main wrapper.</p>\n\n<p>Now, change the transitions of one or more of the child-elements, and see the code update.</p>\n\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>Feel free to implement the editor in a CMS — or have the editors copy the code-snippet, if you want to implement the transitions manually.</p>\n\n<p>Most of the transitions are inspired by <a href=\"https://michalsnik.github.io/aos/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AOS</a>.</p>\n\n",
  "body_markdown": "I love building small tools to help editors and marketeers create more engaging content.\n\nTypically, these tools are super-simple. Often, it's just updating a few _CSS Custom Properties_, a list of `class`-names, `data`-attributes or similar.\n\nI recently build a _CSS Transition Tool_, so editors can fine-tune how an element, or group of elements, enters the screen when scrolling.\n\nA typical example of this is _fade up:_\n\n![Fade up](assets/1190247/8d982a55.gif)\n\nThe tool also allows editors to fine-control the transition of each element in the group:\n\n![Zoom in/out](assets/1190247/fe7fd317.gif)\n\nIf you want to build a similar tool, read on.\n\n---\n\n## Creating the CSS\n\nFirst things first. The tool needs a lot of CSS-classes, that'll control the individual `transform`-properties. To run the transitions (on scroll, using intersection observer), we'll just add a `trs`-class to the outermost (parent) element.\n\nWe'll be using easings from [Open Props](https://open-props.style/), so let's start, by importing those:\n\n```css\n@import 'https://unpkg.com/open-props@1.4.14/src/props.easing.css';\n```\n\nNext, we need some variables:\n\n```css\n:where([class*=\"trs-\"]) {\n  --dg: 100deg;\n  --tx: 55px;\n  --ty: 110px;\n  --zi: 0.6;\n  --zo: 1.2;\n}\n```\n\n`--dg` is for transitions with `degrees`, `--tx` is `x`-offset, `--ty` is `y`-offset, and `zi` and `zo`is used for `zoom`-transitions.\n\nFor the transition-classes, we'll use all of these properties, example \"fade-down\":\n\n```css\n.trs-fdd { opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, calc(-1 * var(--ty)), 0); }\n```\n\n... or \"flip-down\":\n\n```css\n.trs-fld { backface-visibility: hidden; transform: perspective(2500px) rotateX(var(--dg)); }\n```\n\nFor delays, durations and easings, we'll add a bunch of micro-classes:\n\n```css\n.trsde-25 { --delay: 25ms; }\n.trsde-50 { --delay: 50ms; }\n/* .etc */\n```\n\n---\n\nWhen one of the transition-classes has the `trs`-class, we'll _run a transition:_\n\n```css\n:is([class*=\"trs-\"].trs) {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateZ(0) scale(1);\n  transition: all var(--duration, 400ms) var(--delay, 0ms) var(--easing, var(--ease-1, ease));\n}\n```\n\nFor any child-element _within_ a `trs`-class, we'll use:\n\n```css\n:is(.trs [class*=\"trs-\"]) {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateZ(0);\n  transition-timing-function: var(--easing, ease-in-out);\n  transition-delay: var(--delay, 0ms);\n  transition-duration: var(--duration, 400ms);\n}\n```\n\n> You can see all the necessary styles in the demo at the end of this tutorial. \n\n---\n\n## HTML\nNow for some simple markup for previewing the transitions:\n\n```html\n<div id=\"demo\">\n  <div id=\"demo1\">\n    <img src=\"image1.jpg\" />\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"demo2\">\n    <img src=\"image2.jpg\" />\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"demo3\">\n    <img src=\"image3.jpg\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\nFor all the properties we want the editors to play around with, we'll add a `<select>`, with the CSS `class`-names as `<option value>`. \n\nExample:\n\n```html\n<select>\n  <option value=\"trsde-0\" selected>0ms</option>\n  <option value=\"trsde-25\">25ms</option>\n  <option value=\"trsde-50\">50ms</option>\n  ...\n</select>\n```\n\nWe'll group the `<select>`-elements in `<fieldset>`s, one for each child-element in the preview-markup:\n\n```html\n<fieldset name=\"demo\"> ...\n```\n\nNotice the `name=\"demo\"`-part. We'll use that in JavaScript, so all the controls within this fieldset will target the element in the preview-markup with `id=\"demo\"`.\n\nFinally, wrap all the editor-markup within a `<form id=\"app\">`.\n\n---\n\n## JavaScript\nSince we have a `<form>`, we just need a single `input`-event:\n\n```js\napp.addEventListener('input', event => {\n  const node = event.target;\n  const group = node.closest('fieldset');\n  document.getElementById(group.name).className = [...group.elements].map(input => input.value).join(' ').replace(/  +/g, ' ');\n  playIt();\n})\n```\n\nAll there's left to add, is the code for `playIt`, a simple method that removes the `trs`-class, and adds it again after a timeout:\n\n```js\nconst playIt = () => { demo.classList.remove('trs'); setTimeout(() => { demo.classList.add('trs'); }, 400); }\n```\n\nTo help our editors re-trigger the animation, let's add a `<button id=\"play\">`, that'll also run `playIt()`\n\n```js\nplay.addEventListener('click', () => playIt());\n```\n\nAnd that's it. Very little code, but a great help for editors and marketeers!\n\n---\n\n## Demo\nHere's the demo. I recommend you click on \"Edit on Codepen\", and then choose \"Full Screen View\":\n\n{% codepen https://codepen.io/stoumann/pen/zYjxZqB %}\n\nAs soon as you change something in the editor, click on the \"See code\". \n\n_Example:_\n\n![Code snippet](assets/1190247/97a2f85d.png)\n\nHere, you can see, that some of the classes we created in the beginning of this tutorial, has been added to the main wrapper.\n\nNow, change the transitions of one or more of the child-elements, and see the code update.\n\n---\n\nFeel free to implement the editor in a CMS — or have the editors copy the code-snippet, if you want to implement the transitions manually.\n\nMost of the transitions are inspired by [AOS](https://michalsnik.github.io/aos/).",
